WEBVTT

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:02.920
The Digital World,

00:00:02.920 --> 00:00:06.070
a world inhabited by unusual 
creatures called Digimon.

00:00:06.070 --> 00:00:09.950
It has been conquered 
by the evil Bagra Army

00:00:09.950 --> 00:00:14.520
and divided into seven Kingdoms 
ruled by seven Death Generals.

00:00:15.170 --> 00:00:18.250
Taiki Kudou has leapt 
into these seven Kingdoms

00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:22.070
along with his partner, 
Shoutmon, to save the Digimon.

00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:25.730
This is the story of the 
friendship and adventures

00:00:25.730 --> 00:00:28.540
shared by Taiki, his friends, 
and the Digimon.

00:01:51.360 --> 00:01:55.160
Vampire Land is ruled by the 
Death General NeoVamdemon.

00:01:55.600 --> 00:01:57.400
We tried to defeat the immortal

00:01:57.400 --> 00:01:59.880
NeoVamdemon with a surprise attack...

00:02:00.630 --> 00:02:04.970
but he absorbed MetalGreymon 
in a forced DigiXros!

00:02:07.470 --> 00:02:16.010
<b>Don't Die, Greymon!</b>

00:02:07.670 --> 00:02:16.010
<b>The Birth of Shoutmon DX</b>

00:02:09.580 --> 00:02:13.710
Don't Die, Greymon! 
The Birth of Shoutmon DX!

00:02:19.860 --> 00:02:21.420
MetalGreymon's been...

00:02:21.800 --> 00:02:22.850
It can't be...

00:02:23.650 --> 00:02:27.330
This is why they call me a vampire.

00:02:30.260 --> 00:02:33.870
You think I'm gonna let you suck me in?!

00:02:35.400 --> 00:02:36.850
Beelzebumon!

00:02:36.850 --> 00:02:38.640
Use me as a shield to cut him down!

00:02:42.050 --> 00:02:43.680
Why, you...

00:02:44.540 --> 00:02:46.210
Take that!

00:02:47.510 --> 00:02:49.380
Have you forgotten?

00:02:49.380 --> 00:02:55.190
The many Lopmon inside 
me give me immortality.

00:02:59.950 --> 00:03:01.560
Shoutmon X5!

00:03:05.710 --> 00:03:08.970
Now he will also become a part of me.

00:03:12.920 --> 00:03:14.260
Kiriha!

00:03:14.260 --> 00:03:16.510
Lend me your strength!

00:03:16.510 --> 00:03:17.930
Kiriha...

00:03:17.930 --> 00:03:21.180
My... My MetalGreymon...

00:03:21.180 --> 00:03:22.380
Kiriha!

00:03:22.380 --> 00:03:24.830
How dare you do that to my friends!

00:03:28.390 --> 00:03:30.370
Lopmon! What are you doing?!

00:03:31.270 --> 00:03:33.730
Hey, you! Give back my friends!

00:03:34.040 --> 00:03:35.560
What?! A White...

00:03:36.820 --> 00:03:38.930
A White Lopmon?!

00:03:39.930 --> 00:03:43.030
No! Don't come near me!

00:03:43.030 --> 00:03:45.540
Tiny Twister!

00:03:48.830 --> 00:03:50.640
Withdraw, Shoutmon!

00:03:52.170 --> 00:03:53.110
<i>Kiriha...</i>

00:03:56.710 --> 00:03:58.120
We're getting outta here!

00:04:01.490 --> 00:04:02.320
What...

00:04:02.660 --> 00:04:04.000
was that...

00:04:05.730 --> 00:04:08.040
Of course. There's no way.

00:04:08.040 --> 00:04:10.520
It couldn't have been a White Lopmon.

00:04:12.100 --> 00:04:15.750
I have nothing to fear!

00:04:18.740 --> 00:04:21.940
Man, Lopmon really saved us.

00:04:22.740 --> 00:04:24.420
But what can we do?

00:04:24.420 --> 00:04:26.900
His immortality is going 
to be hard to deal with.

00:04:26.900 --> 00:04:27.670
Yeah.

00:04:28.240 --> 00:04:29.360
We defeat him.

00:04:29.360 --> 00:04:32.720
We use our strength to crush him to dust.

00:04:32.720 --> 00:04:35.890
Are you sure? MetalGreymon is part of him.

00:04:36.330 --> 00:04:39.450
MetalGreymon was absorbed because...

00:04:40.780 --> 00:04:43.060
he was too weak!

00:04:43.060 --> 00:04:44.500
You...

00:04:44.500 --> 00:04:46.310
Is that something a General should say?!

00:04:49.220 --> 00:04:51.140
It'll be okay, Kiriha.

00:04:51.140 --> 00:04:54.040
You want to save 
MetalGreymon, too, don't you?

00:04:54.040 --> 00:04:55.830
Don't try to console me!

00:04:55.830 --> 00:04:57.380
You always do that!

00:04:57.380 --> 00:04:59.910
You take everything too lightly!

00:05:00.880 --> 00:05:02.780
The White Lopmon...

00:05:02.780 --> 00:05:03.800
What?

00:05:04.260 --> 00:05:07.110
When Lopmon jumped out in front of him,

00:05:07.110 --> 00:05:08.050
he said...

00:05:08.050 --> 00:05:10.690
<i>A White Lopmon?!</i>

00:05:10.690 --> 00:05:14.350
That's it. He was afraid of something.

00:05:15.160 --> 00:05:17.460
Yes. I heard it, too.

00:05:17.460 --> 00:05:19.690
Something scared him.

00:05:20.180 --> 00:05:22.600
That's why we were able to escape.

00:05:24.090 --> 00:05:27.270
I know what the White Lopmon is.

00:05:27.270 --> 00:05:30.240
The White Lopmon is a legendary Lopmon.

00:05:30.550 --> 00:05:35.010
A legendary Lopmon said 
to have sacred power.

00:05:35.010 --> 00:05:37.120
If we have that sacred power...

00:05:37.820 --> 00:05:39.950
We can save MetalGreymon!

00:05:41.500 --> 00:05:43.320
He has a weakness.

00:05:43.730 --> 00:05:46.320
Well? That's not just consolation, is it?

00:05:48.310 --> 00:05:49.990
I hope not.

00:05:52.500 --> 00:05:55.730
Looks like they've figured 
out where we are.

00:05:58.630 --> 00:06:00.170
Let's go!

00:06:00.940 --> 00:06:03.330
If there is a White Lopmon,

00:06:03.330 --> 00:06:05.710
he'd be in the underground shrine!

00:06:05.710 --> 00:06:06.710
Let's go check it out!

00:06:16.900 --> 00:06:18.420
Here goes!

00:06:18.750 --> 00:06:19.790
Here I come!

00:06:19.790 --> 00:06:22.390
Reload, Deckerdramon!

00:06:28.970 --> 00:06:30.600
I'll hold them off!

00:06:30.600 --> 00:06:32.370
Will you be okay alone?

00:06:32.370 --> 00:06:33.540
There are tons of them!

00:06:34.590 --> 00:06:36.190
Who do you think you're talking to?

00:06:36.190 --> 00:06:38.680
The one who holds the key to our victory

00:06:38.680 --> 00:06:40.350
is the White Lopmon, isn't it?

00:06:40.350 --> 00:06:41.950
Yeah, you're right.

00:06:41.950 --> 00:06:44.270
I'll leave that to you!

00:06:44.270 --> 00:06:46.010
Deckerdra-Launcher!

00:06:46.950 --> 00:06:49.290
Go! Go and find him!

00:06:49.290 --> 00:06:52.360
And then return MetalGreymon to me!

00:06:52.360 --> 00:06:54.110
All right! Wait for us, Kiriha!

00:06:59.970 --> 00:07:02.890
Burn them up until they can't 
regenerate their bodies again!

00:07:03.500 --> 00:07:06.750
I will avenge MetalGreymon!

00:07:09.120 --> 00:07:11.180
They've gone underground?

00:07:11.630 --> 00:07:15.480
That means they've found out 
about the legendary White Lopmon.

00:07:15.840 --> 00:07:17.720
This will be interesting.

00:07:27.250 --> 00:07:29.590
The enemy is everywhere!

00:07:29.590 --> 00:07:31.520
Do we have to go through here?

00:07:31.520 --> 00:07:32.130
Yes.

00:07:32.760 --> 00:07:36.250
Then we'll have to fight our way through.

00:07:36.250 --> 00:07:38.680
I can beat them up, right, Nene?

00:07:38.680 --> 00:07:39.390
Yes.

00:07:40.500 --> 00:07:42.740
Random Laser!

00:07:44.440 --> 00:07:45.440
Let's go!

00:07:45.440 --> 00:07:46.320
Right!

00:07:48.060 --> 00:07:49.350
Let's go, Nene!

00:07:50.280 --> 00:07:51.940
Let's go, Lopmon!

00:07:52.520 --> 00:07:53.920
Let's go...

00:07:53.920 --> 00:07:56.150
Oh, I'm alone...

00:08:29.720 --> 00:08:31.360
We're almost there!

00:08:31.810 --> 00:08:33.690
It's just through that door!

00:08:33.690 --> 00:08:36.890
See? That's the entrance to the shrine!

00:08:38.060 --> 00:08:41.270
I'm sure the White Lopmon is in there,

00:08:41.840 --> 00:08:43.470
the one NeoVamdemon is afraid of!

00:08:43.830 --> 00:08:46.600
We're gonna save you, MetalGreymon!

00:08:50.170 --> 00:08:50.990
Go on.

00:08:51.980 --> 00:08:54.780
They're coming. Leave this to me.

00:08:54.780 --> 00:08:56.040
Nene!

00:08:56.040 --> 00:08:58.680
I'll blow up the bridge soon!

00:08:59.340 --> 00:09:01.670
Since Nene can fly, she'll be fine.

00:09:01.670 --> 00:09:02.790
Let's go!

00:09:06.180 --> 00:09:07.500
Too soon!

00:09:08.260 --> 00:09:10.560
It's no good! We don't have 
time to spend opening it!

00:09:10.560 --> 00:09:12.970
Dorulumon, bust through the door!

00:09:13.730 --> 00:09:14.670
Leave it to me!

00:09:14.670 --> 00:09:16.150
Drill Buster!

00:09:23.000 --> 00:09:24.390
They're still coming?

00:09:24.390 --> 00:09:26.610
No matter how many we take 
down, there's no end.

00:09:28.550 --> 00:09:30.380
What a pain!

00:09:35.950 --> 00:09:38.380
It's not working. The door is too hard.

00:09:38.380 --> 00:09:39.930
Ouch! Hot!

00:09:39.930 --> 00:09:42.790
Ballistamon, try to lift the door up.

00:09:42.790 --> 00:09:45.260
Leave it to me! Finally, it's my turn!

00:09:51.080 --> 00:09:53.040
Way to go, Ballistamon!

00:09:53.040 --> 00:09:53.840
I can get through!

00:09:54.170 --> 00:09:56.370
I can't hold it much longer...

00:09:56.370 --> 00:09:58.450
Thanks! We'll handle the rest!

00:09:58.450 --> 00:10:00.110
Be careful, Taiki!

00:10:00.110 --> 00:10:01.560
I can't hold it!

00:10:01.560 --> 00:10:03.110
Hurry up!

00:10:04.340 --> 00:10:05.720
The door...

00:10:05.720 --> 00:10:06.550
Are you okay?!

00:10:09.600 --> 00:10:10.600
So this is it...

00:10:10.600 --> 00:10:13.420
Oh, yeah! Where's the White Lopmon?

00:10:17.280 --> 00:10:18.100
There!

00:10:20.370 --> 00:10:23.500
White Lopmon, are you there?

00:10:24.150 --> 00:10:26.780
Hey! If you're there, answer us!

00:10:27.870 --> 00:10:28.540
What?!

00:10:33.990 --> 00:10:35.550
White Lopmon?

00:10:36.540 --> 00:10:38.780
White Lopmon, you're there, aren't you?

00:10:39.670 --> 00:10:41.350
He's not here!

00:10:42.180 --> 00:10:44.520
Not here? What's the deal?

00:10:45.930 --> 00:10:48.310
It's exactly as it looks.

00:10:49.490 --> 00:10:50.460
You!

00:10:50.830 --> 00:10:54.250
There's no such thing as a White Lopmon.

00:10:55.770 --> 00:10:57.970
NeoVamdemon! What are you saying?!

00:10:58.340 --> 00:11:00.080
It is true that, in the legends,

00:11:00.080 --> 00:11:03.470
the White Lopmon's power 
is a threat to us.

00:11:03.470 --> 00:11:07.050
But such things do not even exist here.

00:11:07.340 --> 00:11:08.900
That can't be...

00:11:10.380 --> 00:11:12.200
This is the end for you.

00:11:12.200 --> 00:11:15.420
You have come here to become my dinner!

00:11:26.340 --> 00:11:27.330
Get back, Taiki!

00:11:29.200 --> 00:11:30.700
Huh? That melody...

00:11:30.700 --> 00:11:33.200
Yeah, I heard it, too.

00:11:33.200 --> 00:11:37.610
It's him. MetalGreymon is 
still alive inside him!

00:11:38.080 --> 00:11:39.310
You monster!

00:11:41.990 --> 00:11:44.050
What's that? What's going on?

00:11:50.400 --> 00:11:51.470
Where's Shoutmon?

00:11:51.470 --> 00:11:52.610
Quiet!

00:11:56.180 --> 00:11:57.610
Where did you go?

00:11:57.610 --> 00:11:59.430
Come out, or this brat goes first!

00:11:58.910 --> 00:12:04.530
Let me go! Let me go!

00:11:59.430 --> 00:11:59.930
What?

00:12:03.130 --> 00:12:05.940
Taiki, I'm going to do 
something a little reckless.

00:12:06.230 --> 00:12:07.540
What are you planning?

00:12:07.540 --> 00:12:09.170
That melody we heard before...

00:12:10.310 --> 00:12:13.240
It means there's still hope.

00:12:13.240 --> 00:12:15.880
You don't mean... saving 
MetalGreymon from inside him?

00:12:16.210 --> 00:12:20.760
I know what goes on in the body 
of a DigiXros better than anyone.

00:12:20.760 --> 00:12:22.640
So I'm going to do something reckless!

00:12:23.020 --> 00:12:23.960
Shoutmon!

00:12:24.380 --> 00:12:26.640
Hey! If it's me you want, I'm here!

00:12:26.640 --> 00:12:28.290
Let Lopmon go!

00:12:29.130 --> 00:12:32.860
Finally going to give me my meal, are you?

00:12:33.600 --> 00:12:35.910
Darkness Loader!

00:12:42.840 --> 00:12:44.270
Even Lopmon...

00:12:46.980 --> 00:12:49.360
What powerful data!

00:12:49.360 --> 00:12:50.820
My body is...

00:12:51.360 --> 00:12:52.620
Shoutmon...

00:12:57.700 --> 00:12:59.490
Huh? What?

00:12:59.860 --> 00:13:02.890
You came with me, Lopmon?

00:13:03.540 --> 00:13:06.150
I want to save my friends, too.

00:13:06.570 --> 00:13:07.500
I see.

00:13:08.670 --> 00:13:10.440
That melody...

00:13:13.620 --> 00:13:15.440
MetalGreymon!

00:13:15.440 --> 00:13:19.430
So you've finally been absorbed, too.

00:13:19.430 --> 00:13:21.480
Unlike you,

00:13:21.480 --> 00:13:23.770
I came here intentionally.

00:13:23.770 --> 00:13:24.980
What'd you say?

00:13:24.980 --> 00:13:25.950
Listen up.

00:13:25.950 --> 00:13:29.090
I came all this way to 
settle the score with you!

00:13:29.090 --> 00:13:30.160
What?

00:13:30.560 --> 00:13:33.430
That's very amusing.

00:13:33.430 --> 00:13:35.090
But look at me.

00:13:35.090 --> 00:13:37.170
My data is falling apart,

00:13:37.170 --> 00:13:40.630
and already I'm no longer myself.

00:13:41.690 --> 00:13:44.940
I never knew you were such a wimp.

00:13:44.940 --> 00:13:46.380
What did you say?!

00:13:46.380 --> 00:13:48.490
I fought to the end!

00:13:48.490 --> 00:13:50.680
I fought with all my strength!

00:13:50.680 --> 00:13:53.580
Then why can't you hear it?

00:13:53.930 --> 00:13:57.050
Why can't you hear the cries of 
Kiriha fighting for his life,

00:13:57.050 --> 00:13:59.650
all for the slightest hope 
of bringing you back?!

00:14:00.020 --> 00:14:02.120
Kiriha... for me?

00:14:03.380 --> 00:14:05.100
Come on, give me your hand.

00:14:05.100 --> 00:14:06.660
I'll take you there.

00:14:06.660 --> 00:14:09.030
I'll take you back to Kiriha!

00:14:09.030 --> 00:14:10.570
Take me?

00:14:10.570 --> 00:14:13.330
No... It's useless. Don't bother.

00:14:13.330 --> 00:14:16.490
I'm already a part of NeoVamdemon,

00:14:16.490 --> 00:14:18.440
just like all those Lopmon.

00:14:18.860 --> 00:14:21.150
You just don't get it!

00:14:21.150 --> 00:14:23.340
My friends...

00:14:26.210 --> 00:14:27.410
Everyone!

00:14:29.430 --> 00:14:30.880
Stop dillydallying!

00:14:30.880 --> 00:14:33.530
Don't make me any madder than I am!

00:14:33.530 --> 00:14:34.790
Please!

00:14:35.630 --> 00:14:40.200
Please, don't let our 
friends' lives go to waste!

00:14:40.620 --> 00:14:42.060
Your...

00:14:42.060 --> 00:14:45.900
Don't let our lives end like this 
inside NeoVamdemon!

00:14:45.900 --> 00:14:48.870
Please, MetalGreymon!

00:14:49.280 --> 00:14:50.270
You...

00:14:53.210 --> 00:14:54.520
Lopmon...

00:14:57.060 --> 00:14:58.720
Promise us.

00:14:58.720 --> 00:15:00.360
All of us.

00:15:06.400 --> 00:15:07.950
Don't tell me you're...

00:15:07.950 --> 00:15:12.330
There's still something 
that I... that we can do.

00:15:12.800 --> 00:15:14.190
So promise...

00:15:14.740 --> 00:15:17.730
that you'll defeat NeoVamdemon.

00:15:17.730 --> 00:15:19.700
All right, I promise.

00:15:19.990 --> 00:15:23.900
I won't let NeoVamdemon keep 
throwing his weight around!

00:15:24.340 --> 00:15:26.180
It's a promise.

00:15:28.670 --> 00:15:31.530
Everyone! Lend me your strength!

00:15:31.530 --> 00:15:33.580
All of you!

00:15:43.990 --> 00:15:47.160
You're the legendary White Lopmon?!

00:15:50.460 --> 00:15:52.810
We can't hold out any longer!

00:15:52.810 --> 00:15:56.770
Nene, it's okay if we 
lose now and then, right?

00:15:59.380 --> 00:16:00.740
Is this the end of the line already?

00:16:07.310 --> 00:16:08.920
Sorry I'm late.

00:16:08.920 --> 00:16:10.300
Kiriha!

00:16:10.300 --> 00:16:12.820
Deckerdramon! Break down the entrance!

00:16:19.240 --> 00:16:20.430
You couldn't warn us first?!

00:16:20.840 --> 00:16:23.290
<i>MetalGreymon, I'm here!</i>

00:16:27.430 --> 00:16:31.190
What? Something's not 
right. This is not right!

00:16:33.210 --> 00:16:34.850
What's going on?

00:16:36.910 --> 00:16:38.250
Taiki! Are you okay?

00:16:38.250 --> 00:16:39.380
Where's the White Lopmon?

00:16:40.260 --> 00:16:42.150
What? NeoVamdemon is here?

00:16:43.940 --> 00:16:46.670
Shoutmon is inside him now.

00:16:46.670 --> 00:16:48.120
Shoutmon, too?!

00:16:50.220 --> 00:16:51.800
This light...

00:16:52.360 --> 00:16:53.690
It's...

00:16:54.140 --> 00:16:56.030
The light of Digivolution?

00:16:56.030 --> 00:16:59.400
Something big is happening inside him!

00:16:59.400 --> 00:17:00.540
Kiriha!

00:17:00.540 --> 00:17:03.140
Yeah. It's happening to 
my MetalGreymon, too.

00:17:04.240 --> 00:17:05.640
Shoutmon!

00:17:06.700 --> 00:17:09.110
Digivolve! OmegaShoutmon!

00:17:09.110 --> 00:17:10.710
MetalGreymon!

00:17:11.650 --> 00:17:14.280
Digivolve! ZekeGreymon!

00:17:18.150 --> 00:17:19.650
Shoutmon!

00:17:19.650 --> 00:17:21.510
MetalGreymon!

00:17:21.870 --> 00:17:23.250
Digivolve!

00:17:24.220 --> 00:17:26.190
OmegaShoutmon!

00:17:26.590 --> 00:17:29.060
ZekeGreymon!

00:17:30.460 --> 00:17:31.500
This is...

00:17:31.500 --> 00:17:33.530
We Digivolved.

00:17:33.530 --> 00:17:36.230
With the help of the White Lopmon.

00:17:37.550 --> 00:17:40.980
I won't give this body to anyone!

00:17:46.500 --> 00:17:50.930
We still can't overcome his 
power, even with Digivolution?

00:17:53.110 --> 00:17:56.320
ZekeGreymon! Show him your strength!

00:17:57.330 --> 00:17:59.020
Your true strength!

00:17:59.560 --> 00:18:02.030
Kiriha, I...

00:18:02.350 --> 00:18:04.710
Don't give up, ZekeGreymon!

00:18:04.710 --> 00:18:06.260
Show him your strength!

00:18:08.310 --> 00:18:10.540
Combine your strengths into one!

00:18:10.540 --> 00:18:12.040
Our strengths...

00:18:12.490 --> 00:18:13.240
...into one?

00:18:14.130 --> 00:18:16.770
With the last of my strength...

00:18:17.200 --> 00:18:19.160
Combine your strengths...

00:18:19.830 --> 00:18:21.530
into one!

00:18:25.220 --> 00:18:28.010
Keep the promise you made with me...

00:18:28.010 --> 00:18:30.200
With all of us.

00:18:35.170 --> 00:18:36.730
Their strengths are...

00:18:36.730 --> 00:18:38.030
...becoming one!

00:18:39.760 --> 00:18:41.450
OmegaShoutmon!

00:18:41.450 --> 00:18:42.800
ZekeGreymon!

00:18:43.300 --> 00:18:45.040
Double Xros!

00:18:47.070 --> 00:18:49.010
OmegaShoutmon!

00:18:49.010 --> 00:18:51.180
ZekeGreymon!

00:18:51.180 --> 00:18:52.810
Double Xros!

00:18:56.180 --> 00:18:59.110
Shoutmon DX!

00:19:08.130 --> 00:19:09.900
We're back!

00:19:11.880 --> 00:19:15.230
Shoutmon DX is here!

00:19:16.640 --> 00:19:18.760
So he's finally here.

00:19:19.530 --> 00:19:21.210
Yeah, he's finally here...

00:19:21.560 --> 00:19:23.620
Shoutmon DX!

00:19:25.570 --> 00:19:28.520
You will pay for this... My body...

00:19:30.970 --> 00:19:32.440
You will pay!

00:19:33.480 --> 00:19:34.200
What?

00:19:35.190 --> 00:19:37.700
Giga Gardiac Raid!

00:19:38.560 --> 00:19:40.290
Shoutmon DX!

00:19:43.590 --> 00:19:46.430
You're the one who's gonna pay!

00:19:46.430 --> 00:19:47.440
What?

00:19:47.440 --> 00:19:49.430
Trident JusFang!

00:19:52.900 --> 00:19:57.750
You used Lopmon and his friends' 
lives for your own gains!

00:19:58.160 --> 00:19:59.900
I'll make you regret that!

00:20:00.810 --> 00:20:03.750
Have you forgotten that I am immortal?

00:20:03.750 --> 00:20:06.550
This damage is nothing to me.

00:20:06.550 --> 00:20:07.970
Oh, yeah?

00:20:08.590 --> 00:20:11.220
Why? Why am I not recovering?

00:20:11.220 --> 00:20:13.380
My immortality...

00:20:13.380 --> 00:20:15.230
They're gone.

00:20:15.230 --> 00:20:15.730
What?!

00:20:16.040 --> 00:20:20.550
All the Lopmon you were using to 
give you your wretched power...

00:20:20.550 --> 00:20:22.330
They're all gone.

00:20:22.330 --> 00:20:23.670
Lopmon is...

00:20:23.670 --> 00:20:26.920
My power... gone?

00:20:29.410 --> 00:20:35.150
Then I'll devour you again 
and regain my power!

00:20:36.090 --> 00:20:37.250
Lopmon...

00:20:37.250 --> 00:20:40.350
Your promise with me... with all of us.

00:20:40.350 --> 00:20:41.720
That promise...

00:20:42.510 --> 00:20:44.090
will be fulfilled now!

00:20:45.590 --> 00:20:46.890
Victorize...

00:20:47.280 --> 00:20:47.990
What?!

00:20:47.990 --> 00:20:49.960
Banking!

00:21:03.170 --> 00:21:04.180
We did it!

00:21:04.180 --> 00:21:05.820
Yeah, we did.

00:21:09.810 --> 00:21:13.520
Lopmon's not coming back?

00:21:14.310 --> 00:21:17.640
No. Lopmon and his 
friends gave their lives

00:21:18.090 --> 00:21:19.960
to give us strength.

00:21:22.280 --> 00:21:24.630
I kept our promise, Lopmon.

00:21:32.900 --> 00:21:36.270
I will not die! 
Even if this body is destroyed—

00:21:37.360 --> 00:21:40.680
That's not gonna happen, pal.

00:21:44.590 --> 00:21:45.550
It's the sunrise.

00:21:47.670 --> 00:21:50.230
NeoVamdemon's barrier is gone.

00:21:50.840 --> 00:21:54.070
We'll keep fighting so tragedies 
like what happened to the Lopmon

00:21:54.070 --> 00:21:56.230
won't ever happen again.

00:21:59.480 --> 00:22:01.830
On to the next Kingdom!

00:22:02.240 --> 00:22:03.480
Yeah!

00:22:05.060 --> 00:22:07.540
Goodbye, Lopmon.

00:22:07.540 --> 00:22:09.690
<b>To be continued</b>

