00:22:22.820 --> 00:22:34.770
<b>[Attack]</b>

00:22:24.190 --> 00:22:39.570
<b>Mjölnir Thunder</b>

00:22:26.780 --> 00:22:29.360
A mysterious Digimon that 
looks like a parrot.

00:22:29.360 --> 00:22:32.040
Its attack, Mjölnir Thunder, 
brings down lightning

00:22:32.040 --> 00:22:33.250
on the opponent's head.

00:22:33.250 --> 00:22:34.790
Can you say it?

00:22:34.790 --> 00:22:36.950
Mjölnir Thunder! I said it!

00:22:36.950 --> 00:22:39.570
Myomyunyu... I can't!

00:22:41.470 --> 00:22:43.480
Zamielmon has been making the 
citizens of Honey Land suffer

00:22:43.480 --> 00:22:46.900
and forcing a sister and her 
brother to fight, just for fun.

00:22:46.900 --> 00:22:48.750
I will never forgive you!

00:22:49.290 --> 00:22:50.210
DigiXros!

00:22:50.960 --> 00:22:52.180
Digimon Xros Wars!

00:22:52.180 --> 00:22:54.400
<b>Power is Absorbed!</b>

00:22:52.180 --> 00:22:54.400
<b>The Hunters of Honey Land</b>

00:22:52.530 --> 00:22:54.450
You can't turn your back 
on the next one, either!
